<title>HONG KONG: UBS appoints transaction management chief in HK.</title>
<headline>UBS appoints transaction management chief in HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland has appointed Beryl Sze as an executive director in charge of financing and derivatives transaction management, UBS said on Friday.</p>
<p>Sze was previously a senior lawyer with Linklaters and Paines.</p>
<p>She will initially lead a staff of two or three people in Union Bank of Switzerland's legal transaction execution group in Hong Kong, UBS said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
